{"id": "34400", "title": "金冠天使", "author": "岑凯伦", "category": "文学名著", "count": 13, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/34/34400.htm", "intro": "东南亚某富豪的爱女王恬英为逃婚偷渡到了香港，化名田瑛，假说自己是个没有文化的乡下姑娘。富商之子高若望收留了她，两人在互相接触中逐渐产生了爱情，但却引起了高若望圈子中的女朋友们的不满。高若望一如既往地爱着这个“乡下丫头”，最后真相大白，丑小鸭变成了美丽的天鹅，一对有情人也终成眷属。", "base": "files/article/html/34/34400", "chapters": [{"title": "路遇孤女", "file": "2184682.html", "available": false}, {"title": "再见媚姨", "file": "2184683.html", "available": false}, {"title": "父子相吵", "file": "2184684.html", "available": false}, {"title": "帮助好友", "file": "2184685.html", "available": false}, {"title": "无价礼物", "file": "2184686.html", "available": false}, {"title": "无故受害", "file": "2184687.html", "available": false}, {"title": "害人害己", "file": "2184688.html", "available": false}, {"title": "爱被拒绝", "file": "2184689.html", "available": false}, {"title": "发觉被骗", "file": "2184690.html", "available": false}, {"title": "存心报复", "file": "2184691.html", "available": false}, {"title": "如胶似漆", "file": "2184692.html", "available": false}, {"title": "顿变天使", "file": "2184693.html", "available": false}, {"title": "爱如海深", "file": "2184694.html", "available": false}]}